00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:19.383
- Yeah, yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:19.383 --> 00:00:20.580
- I think I was in the, I
think I was in the library.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.420
- [Kelly] The library
with the candle stick.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.253
- Yes, that's right.

00:00:23.253 --> 00:00:25.238
- [Kelly] No, it was
beautiful, it was so cool.

